BEHAVIOR sub-int

DESCRIPTION
  Subtracts b from a (a - b) for signed 64-bit integers. Used by compositions to
  compute lengths, which may not compute themselves.

CONTRACT
  INPUT a int 8
  INPUT b int 8
  OUTPUT result int 8
  GUARANTEES pure no_alloc writes_output

HASH 506d7b8d

IMPLEMENTATION
  va = LOAD a 8
  vb = LOAD b 8
  d = ISUB va vb 8
  STORE result d 8
END
